Wiring for orch-owed-replies (owed-replies inbox REST + MCP parity).
Applies on top of the core branch jill/owed-replies-inbox (server/updates.mjs
listOwedReplies + handoff kind). Apply with: git apply OWED-REPLIES-WIRING.patch
from the repo root. Purely additive: one route, one MCP tool, one openapi path.

--- server/http.mjs
